{"kind": "mod", "id": 1545, "name": "Insurance Plus", "slug": "insurance-plus", "teaser": "Insured items aren't dropped on death.", "owner_name": "Mattdokn", "downloads": 25785, "favourites": 3, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:58.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-10T21:39:42.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-10T21:39:42.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Basics</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>An update to JustNU’s <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/894-insurance\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Insurance+</a> for the latest version of SPT!</p>\n<p>Changes the insurance system to allow you to keep your insured items equipped upon death.</p>\n<p>Item’s dropped in raid will be handled normally through the vanilla game’s return system.</p>\n<p>Make sure you insure container’s with insured items. If the container the item is in isn’t insured then it’ll be lost.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to increase insurance prices you can do so with this mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2117-trader-qol/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TraderQoL</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract mattdokn-insuranceplus.zip into your game folder</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>LoseInsuranceOnItemAfterDeath\n<ul>\n<li>Default: false</li>\n<li>If this is enabled, after dying in raid. The insured items you kept equipped will lose their insured status.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>LoseAmmoInMagazines\n<ul>\n<li>Default: false</li>\n<li>If this is enabled, ammo that is chambered or loaded into an insured magazine/weapon will be removed.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you see anything that stands out to you, please let me know in the comments or submit an <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/m-barneto/InsurancePlus/issues/new\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">issue on github</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insured items inside an uninsured container will not be returned to you on death.</li>\n<li>Bullets in magazines stay after death. (Round in chamber gets removed though lol)</li>\n<li>You are able to insure items that are needed to be placed for quests and get them back after the raid, this won’t be fixed as it would require adding a client component to see if you planted an insured item. <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/894-insurance/#comments/comment28976\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">link</a></li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support My Work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Never feel obligated to donate for support.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mattdokn</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 338, "published_at": "2024-07-12T17:38:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1545/insurance-plus/0.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 869, "published_at": "2024-07-12T17:39:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1545/insurance-plus/1.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.7", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5180, "published_at": "2024-12-23T16:53:56.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1545/insurance-plus/1.2.7", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 7344, "published_at": "2025-05-31T03:47:54.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1545/insurance-plus/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["m-barneto/InsurancePlus"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/m-barneto/InsurancePlus", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}